"usage: firefly-reports [-h] [--url URL] [--token TOKEN] [--start START] [--end END] [--year YYYY] [--owner OWNER] [--currency CURRENCY] [--out OUT] [--lang {en,it}] [--years {3,5}] [--legacy-report] [--tags TAG1,TAG2] [--fetch-links] [--link-delay SEC] [--all-tags] [--no-pdf] [--no-excel] [--accounts-include ID1,ID2] [--accounts-exclude ID1,ID2] [--categories-include C1,C2] [--categories-exclude C1,C2] [--hide-transfers] [--reconciled-only] [--fiscal-year-start MM-DD] [--debug] [--debug-file PATH] {init,export} ... Firefly III -> PDF + Excel report generator (26 reports) positional arguments: {init,export} init Create ./firefly-reports.toml interactively export Export transactions to a plain-text ledger (beancount) options: -h, --help show this help message and exit --url URL Firefly III base URL --token TOKEN Personal Access Token --start START Start date (YYYY-MM-DD) --end END End date (YYYY-MM-DD) --year YYYY Full calendar year mode (unlocks year-only reports: YoY, historical, liquidity forecast). Mutually exclusive with --start/--end --owner OWNER Account owner name (report header) --currency CURRENCY Currency symbol (default: €) --out OUT Output directory (default: ./output) --lang {en,it} Output language (default: en) --years {3,5} Number of years for historical analysis (default: 3) --legacy-report Use legacy PDF report styles --tags TAG1,TAG2 Tags for the tagged transaction report --fetch-links Fetch full details for linked transactions (slower) --link-delay SEC Seconds between requests when fetching linked transactions (default: 0.2) --all-tags Generate a comprehensive report for all tags --no-pdf Skip PDF generation --no-excel Skip Excel generation --accounts-include ID1,ID2 Only these asset account IDs --accounts-exclude ID1,ID2 Exclude these asset account IDs --categories-include C1,C2 Only these categories --categories-exclude C1,C2 Exclude these categories --hide-transfers Drop transfer transactions from all reports --reconciled-only Only reconciled transactions --fiscal-year-start MM-DD Fiscal year start (year mode only, default: 01-01) --debug Enable debug log to file --debug-file PATH Log file path (default: <out>/debug_<timestamp>.log) Firefly III Report Generator ───────────────────────────── Generates all 26 financial reports (PDF + Excel) from Firefly III data. Usage: firefly-reports --url https://firefly.yourdomain.com \\ --token <PAT_TOKEN> \\ --start 2025-01-01 --end 2025-12-31 \\ --owner \"Mario Rossi\" --out ./output Alternative env vars for --url and --token: FIREFLY_URL, FIREFLY_TOKEN"
